 // emulate Sass’ placeholder selectors) we need to include the selectors that extend the
 // placeholders at the root. Then `&:extend(<placeholder> all)` will attach the selectors to every
 // instance of the placeholder.
+// JESS PATCH: dropped the leading `> ` on these two root selectors. jess v5 rejects a
+// stylesheet-root leading combinator by design (DESIGN-DECISIONS P29); less.js accepts it
+// permissively. The `> ` is vestigial here anyway -- `:extend(<ph> all)` substitutes only the
+// selector element, taking its combinator from each placeholder site (all `> \%container-*`),
