-> .container,
-> .container-fluid {
+// JESS PATCH: dropped the leading `> ` from these two root selectors. jess v5 rejects a
+// stylesheet-root leading combinator by design (DESIGN-DECISIONS P29); less.js accepts it
+// permissively. The `> ` is vestigial here: `:extend(<ph> all)` substitutes only the selector
+// element and takes its combinator from each placeholder site (all `> \%container-*`), so
+// lessc 4.x emits byte-identical CSS with or without it (verified over full bootstrap).
+.container,
+.container-fluid {
 	&:extend(\%container-navbar-expand all);
